# Investigative Relevance

This case demonstrates how modern AML and sanctions investigations increasingly involve:
- Beneficial Ownership Analysis  
- Entity Resolution Methodologies  
- Cross-Border Financial Intelligence  
- Operational Screening Validation  
- Governance And Escalation Review  
- Institutional Risk Exposure Assessment  

